<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left">the ownership structures of Xiaopeng Technology, Xiaopeng Smart Mobility, Xiaopeng Motors Sales and each of the Group VIEs in China do not and will not violate any applicable PRC law, regulation, or rule currently in effect; and </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
