<div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto">
 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold">Our Business Model </p> <p style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We offer an innovative mobility experience through our Smart EVs and NEVs, software and services. Vehicle sales is the primary source of our revenues. As of December&#160;31, 2025, we offered seven models, and we plan to continuously introduce new models and facelifts to expand our product portfolio and customer base. </p> <p style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold">General Factors Affecting the Group&#8217;s Results of Operations </p> <p style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The demand for our Smart EVs and NEVs is affected by the following general factors: </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
