<td style="width:10%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left" id="rom36361_23"><span style="font-weight:bold">ITEM&#8201;16E.</span></td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:left">PURCHASES OF EQUITY SECURITIES BY THE ISSUER AND AFFILIATED PURCHASERS </p></td></tr></table> <p style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">As of the date of this annual report, we have not adopted any share repurchase program. The annual general meeting held on June 27, 2025 approved a general mandate to our board of directors to repurchase shares and/or ADSs of the Company not exceeding 10% of the total number of issued shares of the Company as at the date of such approval, for a period until the earliest of (i)&#160;the conclusion of the next annual general meeting, (ii)&#160;the end of the period within which the next annual general meeting is required to be held, and (iii)&#160;when such authority is revoked or varied by an ordinary resolution of our shareholders in general meeting. </p> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">In September 2022, Mr.&#160;Xiaopeng He, our <span style="white-space:nowrap">co-founder,</span> chairman and chief executive officer, through Simplicity Holding Limited, an entity wholly-owned by Mr.&#160;He, purchased a total of 2,200,000 ADSs in the open market in compliance with applicable laws and regulations. The average price paid per ADS was US$13.58. In August 2024, Mr.&#160;He purchased in the open market a total of 1,000,000 Class&#160;A ordinary shares at an average price of HK$27.13 per Class&#160;A ordinary share, and a total of 1,419,922 ADSs at an average price of US$7.02 per ADS through Galaxy Dynasty Limited, an entity wholly-owned by Mr.&#160;He. Furthermore, in August 2025, Mr.&#160;He purchased in the open market a total of 3,100,000 Class&#160;A ordinary shares at an average price of HK$80.49 per Class&#160;A ordinary share through Galaxy Dynasty Limited. </p>
 <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center">-168- </p>

