<td style="width:4%">&#160;</td>
<td style="width:5%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left">(ii)</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">SOP Milestone refers to the start of production (&#8220;SOP&#8221;) of the new vehicle model (&#8220;Qualified New Model&#8221;) specified in the SPA for sales and delivery to ordinary customers. The acquisition of DiDi&#8217;s smart auto business includes a contingent consideration arrangement that requires an additional <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionEquityInterestsIssuedOrIssuableNumberOfSharesIssued" contextRef="P11_13_2023To11_13_2023_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_StartOfProductionMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41359">4,636,447</ix:nonFraction> Class&#160;A ordinary shares to be issued to DiDi if the SOP Milestone is met, which was classified as equity. In estimating the acquisition date fair value of the contingent consideration related to the SOP Milestone, the Company anticipated that the SOP Milestone would be met and the Company will issue these additional <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionEquityInterestsIssuedOrIssuableNumberOfSharesIssued" contextRef="P11_13_2023To11_13_2023_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_StartOfProductionMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41360">4,636,447</ix:nonFraction> Class&#160;A ordinary shares to DiDi upon the date of the SOP. Upon the SOP Milestone being met in July 2024, an additional <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionEquityInterestsIssuedOrIssuableNumberOfSharesIssued" contextRef="P08_13_2024To08_13_2024_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_MilestoneProductionMetMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41361">4,636,447</ix:nonFraction> Class&#160;A ordinary shares was issued and deliveried to DiDi on August&#160;13, 2024. </div></td></tr></table><div style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="text-align:start; BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%">
