<td style="width:4%">&#160;</td>
<td style="width:5%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left">(iii)</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">The acquisition of DiDi&#8217;s smart auto business also includes a contingent consideration arrangement that requires additional Class&#160;A ordinary shares to be issued to DiDi based on (i)&#160;the aggregate delivery volume of the Qualified New Model within the <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">13-month</div> period immediately following the start of delivery (&#8220;First <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">Earn-Out</div> Period&#8221;) reaching <ix:nonFraction name="xpev:NumberOfUnitsToBeDeliveredBasedOnWhichSharesWillBeIssuedContengently" contextRef="P11_13_2023To11_13_2023_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_units" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41362">100,000</ix:nonFraction> at any time during the period, or (ii)&#160;the aggregate delivery volume of the Qualified New Model within the <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">12-month</div> period immediately following the expiry of the First <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">Earn-out</div> Period reaching <ix:nonFraction name="xpev:NumberOfUnitsToBeDeliveredBasedOnWhichSharesWillBeIssuedContengently" contextRef="P11_13_2023To11_13_2023_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_units" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41363">100,000</ix:nonFraction> at any time during the period, both of which is defined as <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">&#8220;Earn-Out</div> Period Milestone&#8221;. The range of shares to be issued related to the <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">Earn-Out</div> Period Milestone is between <ix:nonFraction name="xpev:BusinessCombinationSharesToBeIssuedContingentlyMinimum" contextRef="PAsOn11_13_2023_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:fixed-zero" id="ixv-41364">nil</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction name="xpev:BusinessCombinationSharesToBeIssuedContingentlyMaximum" contextRef="PAsOn11_13_2023_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41365">28,331,126</ix:nonFraction>, leading to the range of fair value of the contingent consideration between <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationArrangementsRangeOfOutcomesValueLow" contextRef="PAsOn11_13_2023_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:fixed-zero" id="ixv-41366">nil</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationArrangementsRangeOfOutcomesValueHigh" contextRef="PAsOn11_13_2023_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41367">1,592,071</ix:nonFraction> on the acquisition date. In estimating the acquisition date fair value of the contingent consideration related to the <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">Earn-Out</div> Period Milestone, which is classified as a derivative liability, the Group performed a scenario analysis and determined the fair value based on the total contingent shares to be issued under each scenario, the expected probabilities of each scenario and the closing price of the Company&#8217;s common share on the acquisition date. As of December&#160;31, 2024, the fair value of the contingent consideration related to the <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">Earn-Out</div> Period Milestone was RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationLiability" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41368">167,940</ix:nonFraction>, with a fair value gain of RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationArrangementsChangeInAmountOfContingentConsiderationLiability1" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41369">234,245</ix:nonFraction> and foreign currency translation adjustment of RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ForeignCurrencyTransactionGainLossBeforeTax" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41370">8,712</ix:nonFraction> recorded in the consolidated statements of comprehensive loss, primarily due to the derecognition of the derivative liability related to the First <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">Earn-Out</div> Period Milestone, and the range of fair value of the contingent consideration was between <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationArrangementsChangeInTheRangeOfOutcomesContingentConsiderationLiabilityValueLow" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_MinimumMembersrtRangeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:fixed-zero" id="ixv-41371">nil</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationArrangementsChangeInTheRangeOfOutcomesContingentConsiderationLiabilityValueHigh" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_MaximumMembersrtRangeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41372">619,156</ix:nonFraction>. As of December&#160;31, 2025, the fair value of the contingent consideration related to the <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">Earn-Out</div> Period Milestone was RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationLiability" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41373">281,009</ix:nonFraction>, with a fair value loss of RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationArrangementsChangeInAmountOfContingentConsiderationLiability1" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_CommonClassAMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_EarnOutPeriodMilestoneMemberusgaapContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis_XiaojuGroupMemberusgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-