<td style="width:5%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left">(i)</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left; line-height: normal;text-indent: 0px;"><div style="letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">Construction in progress is primarily comprised of ongoing construction of the Group&#8217;s production facilities, equipment and tooling utilized in the Group&#8217;s manufacture. For the years ended December 31, 2023, 2024 and 2025, the Group capitalized</div>&#160;RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AccumulatedCapitalizedInterestCosts" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2023_ConstructionInProgressMemberusgaapPropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41499">107,415</ix:nonFraction>, RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AccumulatedCapitalizedInterestCosts" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2024_ConstructionInProgressMemberusgaapPropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41500">31,878</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AccumulatedCapitalizedInterestCosts" contextRef="PAsOn12_31_2025_ConstructionInProgressMemberusgaapPropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41501">15,220</ix:nonFraction> <div style="letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">of gross interest expenses, respectively. Government grants related to capitalized interest expense were accounted for as a reduction of capitalized costs associated with the construction of the production facilities. The benefits of these grants are subsequently recognized through a corresponding reduction in depreciation charges over the useful lives of these assets.&#160;</div> </div></td></tr></table><div style="font-size: 6pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">&#160;</div>
