t="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41933">200,000</ix:nonFraction>, RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireLimitedPartnershipInterests" contextRef="P12_20_2020To12_20_2020_GuangzhouXiaopengAutomaticDrivingTechnologyCoLtdMembersrtOwnershipAxis_KunpengChuangyeLlpMemberXPEVLimitedLiabilityPartnershipAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41934">10</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireLimitedPartnershipInterests" contextRef="P12_20_2020To12_20_2020_GuangzhouGetInvestmentMembersrtOwnershipAxis_KunpengChuangyeLlpMemberXPEVLimitedLiabilityPartnershipAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41935">160,000</ix:nonFraction> paid in capital in Kunpeng Chuangye LLP in return for <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LimitedLiabilityCompanyLLCOrLimitedPartnershipLPMembersOrLimitedPartnersOwnershipInterest" contextRef="P12_20_2020To12_31_2020_ChengxingMembersrtOwnershipAxis_KunpengChuangyeLlpMemberXPEVLimitedLiabilityPartnershipAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="6" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41936">55.5540</ix:nonFraction>%, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LimitedLiabilityCompanyLLCOrLimitedPartnershipLPMembersOrLimitedPartnersOwnershipInterest" contextRef="P12_20_2020To12_31_2020_GuangzhouXiaopengAutomaticDrivingTechnologyCoLtdMembersrtOwnershipAxis_KunpengChuangyeLlpMemberXPEVLimitedLiabilityPartnershipAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="6" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41937">0.0028</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LimitedLiabilityCompanyLLCOrLimitedPartnershipLPMembersOrLimitedPartnersOwnershipInterest" contextRef="P12_20_2020To12_31_2020_GuangzhouGetInvestmentMembersrtOwnershipAxis_KunpengChuangyeLlpMemberXPEVLimitedLiabilityPartnershipAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="6" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-41938">44.4432</ix:nonFraction>% of the equity interests, respectively. The